    <rigor-reason>Edits shared `Services/Communication/` code that email-communication-solution-r4 shipped (`ThreadContinuityRung`, `CommunicationService`) — the highest-risk, shared-code part of R1. Introduces a net-new `IThreadResolver` seam invoked on BOTH the inbound capture path and the outbound send path for ALL channels; touches `.cs`; FULL protocol + Step 9.5 gates required. `parallel-safe: false` — serializes the shared-path edit within W4.</rigor-reason>
