    <criterion testable="true">It is invoked from BOTH `ThreadContinuityRung` (inbound) and `CommunicationService` (outbound); registered via `CommunicationModule`, unconditional.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">An email reply joins its parent's thread; a fresh outbound email creates a thread — verified by test.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A chat (`Message`) inbound joins its ACS thread; a fresh chat message creates a thread — verified by test.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">**Existing email flows continue to pass (characterization tests green)** — the pre-existing email inbound matching + outbound send behaviors are unchanged before and after the extension.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Thread assignment is best-effort/non-fatal (NFR-02): a simulated resolver failure does NOT fail send/capture; the message still persists (without `sprk_thread`).</criterion>
